#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/01_the_noghri_prisoner.cfg:102
#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/02_honoghr.cfg:93
#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/08_aboard_the_katana.cfg:110
#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/10_honoghrs_choice.cfg:104
#: scenarios/heir_to_the_empire/02_ambush_at_bpfassh.cfg:147
