#. [message]: speaker=sw_hero_lando
#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/04_the_senators_men.cfg:140
msgid "Stormtroopers at both ends of the street, Han. I think our informant sold us twice."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=sw_hero_han
#: scenarios/dark_force_rising/04_the_senators_men.cfg:144
msgid "Then we go through the middle. The Falcon's at the north pad. Stay low."
